<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 492 0 R
/E (Work Colleague Relationships: Eight hours a day with people you'd never voluntarily spend time with, united only by paycheck and shared frustration. Context-dependent friendships that rarely survive job changes; you learn to perform and maintain professional distance while sometimes forming genuine bonds beneath it all.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1615 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 492 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 42 0 R
