1616 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 492 0 R
/E ("Situationships": \(Undefined Romantic Ambiguity\) That thing where you're not sure what you are. You hang out, maybe sleep together, definitely care, but there's no conversation about it. It lives in the liminal space between friendship and romance; it's often painful because the uncertainty prevents true commitment and leaves one person usually wanting more.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1617 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
