<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 493 0 R
/E (First Meetings & Social Scripts: The choreography of meeting someone new: small talk, surface questions, testing for safety. There are invisible rules about what you reveal and when. Some people break these rules immediately and create instant intimacy; others follow them perfectly and stay forever distant.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
