1624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 493 0 R
/E (Love Languages: The five ways humans give and receive love: words of affirmation, acts of service, receiving gifts, quality time, physical touch. Your partner might be showing up every single way except the one you actually feel. You're starving for words while they're drowning you in acts of service. It's the tragedy of two people trying to love each other but speaking different languages.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1625 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 493 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1626 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 493 0 R
/E (Personal Boundaries: The yes and no that protect you. Healthy boundaries aren't walls; they're information: "I need space after conflict" or "I don't lend money to family" or "I need you to ask before offering advice." Boundaries require clarity about your own limits, consistency, and the willingness to disappoint others. Many people mistake boundaries for rejection.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1627 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
