1628 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 494 0 R
/E (pattern. Someone proves through repeated small actions that they're reliable. They remember what you said last month. They show up when they say they will. They don't weaponize your vulnerabilities. Safety is the nervous system knowing: this person won't harm me. It takes months or years to build and seconds to shatter.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1629 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 494 0 R
/E (Conflict Resolution: Patterns How you fight reveals everything. Do you attack, withdraw, cry, shut down, get logical, get emotional? These are usually the same patterns you learned in your family. Some people repair immediately; others ruminate for weeks. Some avoid conflict entirely until it explodes; others seem to need it to feel connected. Most couples have the same fight over and over because they never address the pattern itself.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
