/P 495 0 R
/E (Emotional Attunement: \(Right-Brain to Right-Brain Connection\) Beyond words. It's the felt sense of being with someone who gets your rhythm, your pain, your unspoken needs. You don't have to explain yourself. They pick up on your micro-expressions, your tone shift, your energy. This connection happens pre-verbally, beneath conscious awareness. Some people are naturally attuned; others have to learn it.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [1]
>>
