/E (Group Dynamics & Triangles: \(When a Third Party Changes Everything\) Two people has one dynamic; three people creates multiple pairs, alliances, and power shifts. The addition of another person can dilute intensity, create competition, build community, or destroy balance. Sometimes you need someone else to relieve pressure in a couple; sometimes a third person is the poison that destroys the bond.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [9]
>>
