<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 496 0 R
/E (Interdependence vs. Independence: \(The Balance\) The paradox: the healthiest relationships are between people secure enough to be fully independent and also fully interdependent. Not clinging because you're afraid to be alone \(anxious attachment\) and not distant because you don't trust anyone \(avoidant attachment\). Real love is choosing someone knowing you could survive without them, but choosing not to.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [1]
>>
