/E (Rituals & Traditions: \(The Glue\) Regular patterns that mark the relationship as special: Sunday dinners, annual trips, Friday movie nights, birthday traditions. Rituals anchor belonging. They signal "this matters enough to repeat" and they create shared history. Without rituals, relationships can feel random and unstable. With them, they feel like home.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [5]
