/E (Mirror Neurons & Embodied Understanding: Neural cells that fire both when you act and when you watch someone else act. This is why you feel pain when someone you love is hurt; why you yawn when someone else yawns; why you cry at sad movies. Mirror neurons create empathy at a pre-conscious level. They're the biological basis of "I feel you.")
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [5]
