/E (The Polyvagal System: \(Why You Freeze, Fight, or Connect\) The vagus nerve runs from your brain through your gut; it determines whether you're in social engagement mode \(safe, connected, creative\), sympathetic activation \(fight/flight anxiety\), or parasympathetic collapse \(freeze/shutdown\). Trauma and insecure attachment dysregulate this system. Safe relationships help re-regulate it.)
/Pg 48 0 R
