/E (Neuroplasticity & Relational Healing: \(New Wiring Through Connection\) Your brain isn't fixed. Through new relational experiences, neural pathways can literally change. Someone who was never validated by their parents can be rewired by a partner who consistently validates them. This takes time and repetition, but it's possible. Secure relationships can quite literally reshape trauma-altered brains.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [4]
>>
