/E (Quantum Entanglement: \(Metaphorical Connection Beyond Space\) Two particles once connected remain correlated across distance without any known mechanism of communication. While this is purely physical phenomenon and not actually applicable to human relationships, the metaphor is powerful: some people feel connected across distance; information seems to travel between them in ways physics can't explain. Whether metaphor or reality, the experience is real.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [3]
>>
