/S /P
/P 502 0 R
/E (The Anthropic Principle: \(You're Connected by Existing in Same Universe\) The anthropic principle suggests that the universe is the way it is because we're here to observe it. Extending this: humans are connected through the simple fact of existing in the same cosmos, at the same time, shaped by the same evolutionary pressures and physical laws. This common ground is the basis of all connection.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [4]
>>
