1700 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 502 0 R
/E (The Holographic Principle: \(The Whole Reflects in Every Part\) The holographic principle suggests that the entire universe might be encoded in any part of it. Metaphorically: every person contains the whole of humanity; every relationship contains all possible relationships; every moment contains eternity. This challenges the idea that relationships are separate, bounded events.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
